ed years ago. A bomb blast at an orphanage becomes a new puzzle to solve.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/47IvNO6vFQfWC0PhmGGbGyULi16.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9NdXRodSUyMEFsaWFzJTIwS2FhdHRhYW4lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"The Fragrance of Henna","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2026-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"In Tamil Nadu, Kaalai Pandian listens to Sittu's story of Muthu and Meena's blooming love. In Kerala, Benny remembers how Muthu calmed an elephant's fury.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/i1JntDQhHMn17vIPoTjmoZ7JBvW.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9NdXRodSUyMEFsaWFzJTIwS2FhdHRhYW4lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Sleepless City Blues","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2026-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The relationship between Muthu and Meena in Madurai comes to light. A chance encounter in the forest reveals how Muthu's courage set Benny's political journey in motion.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zHWDWAE1RuZk7gbJ9V1BoDGeSY5.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9NdXRodSUyMEFsaWFzJTIwS2FhdHRhYW4lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Things Fall Apart","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2026-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Sidharthan finds Jessy, who narrates Muthu's stint at the orphanage a decade back, ending in a bomb blast. Benny agrees to meet the investigators.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5xGgXGZVCf4yx7Joqe5TqhqtR5N.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvSGluZGkvMjAyNi9NdXRodSUyMEFsaWFzJTIwS2FhdHRhYW4lMjAlMjgyMDI2JTI5Lw.1.7","title":"Friends, Foes and Fortunes","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2026-03-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Benny reveals more about Sivendra's secretive life and a long-standing rivalry. But Sidharthan suspects there's more to the story than what he's being told.","thumbnail":"https: